WEBVTT

00:07.500 --> 00:28.000
Seeing the elites of the Eastern Camp approaching rapidly, Zhu Yuanzhi decisively abandoned the rescue of his comrades, leading the remaining cavalry in retreat.

00:35.640 --> 00:38.880
General they retreated too quickly didn't catch them all.

00:41.040 --> 00:45.960
Prince of Jin that rabbit emperor in the south has raised a wolf.

00:47.400 --> 00:52.920
Just lost some tents General Shi's fifty thousand troops no matter how he schemes it's just.

00:53.000 --> 00:55.880
A breeze brushing fur what do you know?

00:56.560 --> 00:59.520
When two armies fight it's all about momentum.

01:00.640 --> 01:06.440
The Xuan people's arrows have almost all been used on the refugees call the craftsmen the finished catapults.

01:06.920 --> 01:12.000
At dawn send two units to attack the city in rotation on the other side work faster too.

01:12.120 --> 01:13.520
Yes.

01:21.280 --> 01:26.040
Send people out of the city to recover arrows as much as possible at the same time open the southern grain storehouse.

01:26.120 --> 01:30.880
Reward our troops for the successful raid have the soldiers celebrate together.

01:31.480 --> 01:32.880
Yes.

01:35.600 --> 01:41.800
This General Zhu truly has the courage of a bear and tiger I saw in the Wuzhao camp flames reaching the sky truly satisfying pity.

01:41.880 --> 01:47.800
Only good food no wine I think this meal is like a last meal zhu Yuanzhi showed off.

01:48.400 --> 01:49.800
Won't the Wuzhao retaliate?

01:49.960 --> 01:56.080
Maybe they'll launch a full attack tonight lately I can't sleep well always hear thumping sounds.

01:56.480 --> 02:02.880
Always dream of Wuzhao warhorses trampling down on me shut up and eat stop thinking about this and that scaring yourself.

02:04.000 --> 02:13.500
On the fourth day, Wu Jun bombarded the ramparts with catapults and launched a massive assault with scaling ladders, only gradually retreating at daybreak on the fifth day. The surviving defenders collapsed in exhaustion, having not even the strength to gather the remains of their fallen comrades.

02:14.960 --> 02:20.320
Although we've repelled the enemy but arrows are exhausted all kinds of weapons and traps.

02:20.480 --> 02:26.280
Are also severely depleted also need to immediately assign people to urgently repair the city walls.

02:26.920 --> 02:28.040
How many men do we have left?

02:28.120 --> 02:33.960
Heavy casualties now only about two thousand can still fight if the Wuzhao attack again at most we can.

02:34.280 --> 02:36.880
Hold for two days report.

02:37.920 --> 02:43.667
There's an army to the south approaching us they don't look like Wuzhao Chen Ying's reinforcements have arrived.

02:44.480 --> 02:46.147
Let's go take a look.

03:06.880 --> 03:08.400
Who goes there?

03:10.360 --> 03:14.320
I'm Liu Dadao Commander of Yong'an Garrison's Left Army.

03:15.200 --> 03:21.360
These are all the lords of northern fortresses zhang, Huang, Liu, Li the four great families.

03:21.520 --> 03:25.760
Have also come although we're in the north in our hearts.

03:25.840 --> 03:31.680
We always recognize the Xuan on this flag everyone heard the royal army is trapped in Yiyang.

03:31.840 --> 03:35.280
Specially led the northern volunteer army to come and help.

03:39.480 --> 03:44.640
Great Xuan's old subjects Great Xuan's old subjects willing to die for Great Xuan.

03:44.760 --> 03:49.680
Willing to die for Great Xuan it's reinforcements our reinforcements.

03:52.600 --> 03:54.760
Your Highness look.

